WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.633 --> 00:00:07.140
The Team Board is where a team plans its work: a backlog, a board by stage, and sprints, if you work that way.

2
00:00:08.233 --> 00:00:13.204
Pick your team. The backlog holds what’s next. Drag tickets into a sprint to plan it.

3
00:00:13.667 --> 00:00:18.125
Kanban Board shows the sprint by stage. Move a card as the work moves on.

4
00:00:18.567 --> 00:00:27.569
Sprint metrics shows how the sprint is going. Completed against the current scope, what was committed at the start, what was added or removed, and what’s left.

5
00:00:28.033 --> 00:00:35.628
The burndown shows what’s left each day, against an even burn. Velocity compares committed and completed, sprint by sprint.

6
00:00:36.067 --> 00:00:42.851
Below, see who’s done what, and the tickets added, removed or still open. Count in tickets, or story points.

7
00:00:43.300 --> 00:00:47.225
Deleting a sprint moves its unfinished tickets back to the backlog.

